---
import SimpleLayout from "../../layouts/SimpleLayout.astro";

const description = "Privacy Policy for Password game : duel.";
---

<SimpleLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Password game : duel"
  description={description}
  robots="index, follow"
  themeColor="#12002b"
>
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <article class="legal-card">
      <p class="legal-kicker">Password game : duel</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last updated: April 22, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Publisher</h2>
      <p>Bubble App Studio — contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz</p>

      <h2>2. Permissions used by the app</h2>
      <p>
        Password game : duel may ask for access to the camera, microphone, and screen
        recording features. These permissions are used only to play a local round and create
        a replay if you choose to export or share it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Replays remain on your device unless you decide to save or share them.
      </p>

      <h2>3. No account or server upload</h2>
      <p>
        The app does not require an account. Bubble App Studio does not operate backend
        servers for this app and does not upload gameplay videos, camera content, microphone
        content, contacts, or location.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Purchases</h2>
      <p>
        If the app is purchased through the App Store, the transaction is handled by Apple.
        Bubble App Studio does not receive your payment card details.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Advertising and tracking</h2>
      <p>
        The app does not request App Tracking Transparency permission, does not access the
        IDFA, and does not serve targeted advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, contact us at contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The online version prevails.</p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <style>
    :global(body) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(760px 520px at 50% 0%, rgba(98, 0, 255, 0.3), transparent 64%),
        radial-gradient(680px 460px at 85% 90%, rgba(216, 255, 0, 0.12), transparent 66%),
        #070010;
    }

    :global(body)::before {
      opacity: 0.08;
    }

    .legal-page {
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 72px);
    }

    .legal-card {
      width: min(900px, 100%);
      background: rgba(12, 0, 31, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px);
      box-shadow:
        0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 48px rgba(98, 0, 255, 0.14);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .legal-kicker {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #d8ff00;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .legal-date {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-family: "SF Pro Rounded", "SF Pro Display", "SF Pro Text", -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: #f5f0ff;
    }

    p,
    li {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    a {
      color: #d8ff00;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</SimpleLayout>
